# Backend-only advisors data: the cleartext is private and must never be
# committed to this public repo. Only the encrypted advisors.json.enc is
# tracked (see scripts/tools/advisors_crypto.py).
data/processed/advisors.json

# CLI build intermediates. The bundle (~7 MB) is regenerated from the frontend
# data on every pipeline run and consumed in-process by build_cli_sqlite.py to
# produce the cli.sqlite that ships on the orphan `cli-dist` branch — nothing
# reads the committed copy, so tracking it just added ~7 MB of blob per data
# commit. cli-merger-manifest.json backs a not-yet-implemented per-record sync
# path and has no reader either.
#
# cli-manifest.json IS still tracked: generate-cli-data.sh reads its
# `version` and `bundle_sha256` to decide whether the data changed and what
# version to stamp next. Without it every run would look changed and reset to
# v1. Regenerate the bundle locally with `./scripts/generate/generate-cli-data.sh`.
data/output/cli/cli-bundle.json
data/output/cli/cli-merger-manifest.json

# Scraper working artifact: the paginated register index is re-fetched fresh at
# the start of every scrape run and only used within that run to derive matter
# links. It changes on every fetch (session token / ordering) even when no
# merger data has changed, so committing it just adds noise.
data/raw/acquisitions-register.html

# Wrangler local state (Cloudflare Pages at the repo root, plus every Worker
# under workers/). Regenerated by `wrangler dev`/`deploy`.
.wrangler/
